# TM modes are weaker confined: lower index than TE at the same thickness.
# Reference: SciPy root of the TM dispersion relation.
title 340 nm silicon slab, TM polarisation
stack core=0.34
polarisation tm
grating angle=10 etch=0.05
expect n_full 2.79612332 2e-07
expect n_etched 2.56115004 2e-07
expect n_grating 2.67863668 2e-07
expect group_index 4.30491266 0.0002
